        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Being labeled by unions carries significance and warrants a public response.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "College radio provides a legitimate platform for discussing campus-related political positions.",
        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
