    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/3/73272.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 6,
    "turn_text": "Sure, I mean, I am lucky to enjoy the broad support of labor. I have received the endorsement of almost every union. And that is because I believe that unions are the lifeblood of preserving the middle class in this country. I think we're looking at a time where the cost, as many of your students know, the cost of achieving higher education. has become almost unaffordable for a large number of students and I think unions actually provide a pathway to a lucrative career where you could maybe not take on as much educational debt and find an alternate career in a trade that will enable you to support your family and continue to live here on Long Island. I think it's really vital that we preserve that pathway for young men and women who want to make that choice. I am very much in favor of supporting labor and I'm glad to have the support back.",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
    "inferred_speaker_name": null,
    "inferred_speaker_role": null,
    "chosen_text_key": "transcript",
    "explicit_propositions": [
