    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/3/73272.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 9,
    "turn_text": "That's the big thing. Let's hope more of them get that idea because it really is. I think you're right on the money. That's the only way that the middle class is going to get a leg up somehow. to battle all the forces that are keeping them. Interestingly, we talk about the Federal Reserve, and every time they come in and they want to, okay, we need to stop the inflation. But they only seem to look at people's wages. I never ever hear any of these financial people talking about the inflationary impact of giant corporate profits. That never seems to be in the conversation. It's always about raising the interest rate so we can lower salaries and tamp the people down. That's annoying.",
