      }
    ],
    "turn_type_label": "Substantive",
    "conversation_move_label": "Assert / Elaborate"
  },
  {
    "episode_id": 73272,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/3/73272.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 10,
    "turn_text": "It's a challenge when you see inflation about the best way to react. There's countervailing concerns. You want people to have jobs. You want people to be able to spend money and stimulate our economy. But yet when there's too much overstimulation, we have to do something to bring prices down. Sorry to go",
