    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/3/73272.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 33,
    "turn_text": "Sure. I mean, people like my opponent, you know, they champion the causes of the NRA and their agenda, but this is a common sense agenda. No one's saying we're going to repeal the Second Amendment. No one's saying that law abiding citizens who engage in hunting can't go and get a gun to go and pursue that activity. What we're talking about is common sense, universal background checks. Okay. Why? Why would we ever not want that to make sure that people were not giving guns to criminals. Red flag logs, even stronger than the ones that have already been passed, to make sure we're keeping guns out of the hands of mentally ill people that will prevent suicides and will also prevent the mass casualties that we've seen perpetrated by mentally ill people who go and kill children, kill people at parades, kill people at places of worship. It's just common sense. And then we also need to get assault weapons off our streets. There's no justification that any normal person needs a military assault rifle for any purpose. It's common sense. And if those were off the streets and banned, we would be a lot safer. And that's what I want to do to make all of us safer. There's no reason a parent should be terrified of sending their children to school because they might get shot.",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
    "inferred_speaker_name": null,
    "inferred_speaker_role": null,
    "chosen_text_key": "transcript",
    "explicit_propositions": [
      {
        "text": "The speaker supports universal background checks.",
        "confidence": 0.97
      },
      {
        "text": "There is no legitimate reason for ordinary individuals to possess military-style assault rifles.",
        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "Red flag laws should be strengthened beyond current versions.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker believes their proposed reforms would increase public safety.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "Assault weapons should be banned from civilian use.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Common sense gun safety measures would reduce mass shootings and suicides.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Current gun policies allow guns to fall into the hands of criminals and mentally ill individuals.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Parents currently fear for their children's safety due to the risk of school shootings.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      }
    ],
    "assumptions": [
      {
        "text": "The audience accepts that reducing gun violence is a desirable goal.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
