    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/3/73272.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 39,
    "turn_text": "Okay. Now voter turnout was kind of low in the primaries. You think you think you can motivate the Democrats to get out and vote in your district?",
