        "text": "New York has never held a congressional primary in August before.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "Holding an election in late August is problematic due to timing near Labor Day and the start of school.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Low voter turnout in the primary was largely explained by the atypical timing and lack of awareness.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Late August is considered one of the most unproductive weeks for voter engagement due to vacations.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Many people were unaware of the August primary because it’s outside normal expectations.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "This year’s general election features a high-profile gubernatorial race.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Voters are likely motivated by key issues such as abortion rights and gun policy.",
