    "turn_idx": 87,
    "turn_text": "No, it's not okay. It really is not okay. I mean, when someone tells me they're a patriot, I say, okay, if you're, if you're a patriot, part of your job is to keep an eye on your elected officials and call them out when they do stuff you don't like. That's, that's being a patriot. But, but it's like now today, they'll, they'll pick on the president. Okay, well, that's part of his job. I mean, he's the focal point. You don't like something he did, right? You talk about it. But then don't turn around and tell me that that other guy would have been better. That blows my mind. It really does. And we were talking before about the voters having to figure out a lot of this stuff to wade through the lies. You know there hasn't been a lot of money for education in the last my almost 30 years and it's evident it's showing",
